{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n \\\"transaction|transact|defn (step|publish-index|index-datoms|consume|observe)|:dao.space/transaction|metadata|:m |row relation|program-out|\\\\[root rows\\\\]\\\" src/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc docs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.md docs/design/yin.vm.semantic.md docs/design/yin.vm.macro.md | head -180\"","aggregated_output":"src/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:2:  \"The transactor-side indexing library (docs/design/dao.jing.md, Publication\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:6:   transactor, so every agent also owns indexing its own datoms. This\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:237:(defn index-datoms\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:412:  (if (and (map? payload) (contains? payload :dao.space/transaction))\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:413:    (let [tx (:dao.space/transaction payload)\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:424:        (throw (ex-info \"malformed dao.space transaction record\"\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:437:          \"local stream payload must be a datom or dao.space transaction record\"\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:446:   atomic {:dao.space/transaction {:t n :datoms [...]}} record flattens to\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:564:(defn publish-index!\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:565:  \"The transactor entry point, agent-side (docs/design/dao.jing.md,\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:569:      any publication append. Atomic transaction records are flattened here.\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:702:   [:unresolved :m :tempid] :allocate,\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:703:   [:unresolved :m :reserved] :pass,\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:704:   [:unresolved :m :user-positive] :defect,\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:711:   [:resolved :m :tempid] :defect,\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:712:   [:resolved :m :reserved] :pass,\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:713:   [:resolved :m :user-positive] :pass})\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/index.cljc:730:   happens only for declared attri